      "message": "This is thrown by external/libdav1d several time (~100). What appears to be happening in this case is that the projects Android.bp file has \"-Wall, -Werror, -Wextra\", followed by a \"-Wno-error\u003dunused-parameter\".\n\nThis maybe goes to the meta question of whether projects should be allowed to add \"-Wall, -Wextra\", given how frequently this adds noise to the build output.",
